Position: Switch Hardware Development Engineer
Location: Shenzhen, Li ning center
Effective time: on December 31, 2023
Job Responsibilities:
Responsible for hardware research and development of switches
Responsible for manufacturing communication of the products
Participate in module design technology reserve
Job Requirements:
Bachelor’s degree in in Computer/communication/electronics;
3+ years of switch product development experience;
Broadcom/Marvell Realtek/Centec any chip platform hardware design experience;
Willing to participate in internal learning exchanges and share personal experiences;
Team cooperation.
Send resume to: liuchi@hohunet.com
Position: Software engineer — switch direction
Location: Shenzhen, Li ning center
Effective time: on December 31, 2023
Responsibilities:
Responsible for switch product system software development/maintenance/iteration;
Switch product software defect repair;
Communication and support with key customer R&D to R&D.
Requirements:
Proficient in the development and debugging of device drivers under rt-thread system;
Familiar with I2C, MDC/MDIO and other bus protocols;
Experience in SCM software development;
Experience in PHY driver development is preferred;
Experience in exchange software development is preferred;
Experience in embedded web front-end or back-end development is preferred.
Send resume to: liuchi@hohunet.com
